{"id":"sacrifice","lemma":"sacrifice","pos":"noun","rank":2406,"glosses":["sacrifice"],"ipa":"/sa.kʁi.fis/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3a/Fr-sacrifice.ogg/Fr-sacrifice.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"sacrifices"},"formAudio":{"sacrifices":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b5/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-sacrifices.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"J'ai fait beaucoup de sacrifices.","en":"I've made a lot of sacrifices.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Nous avons fait des sacrifices.","en":"We made sacrifices.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Ton sacrifice ne fut pas vain.","en":"Your sacrifice was not in vain.","words":[{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"bole","l":"fût"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"useless"}]},{"text":"Nous avons besoin de faire des sacrifices.","en":"We need to make sacrifices.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"need"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Ils ont tué une chèvre en sacrifice aux dieux.","en":"They killed a goat as a sacrifice to the gods.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to kill","l":"tuer"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"goat"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,{"g":"to the"},{"g":"a god, male divinity","l":"dieu"}]}]}